vesting, and down-stream wood-processing and distribution activities in Europe, Africa, Asia, South America, North America, and China. It operates through two segments, Direct Purchase and Original Design Manufacturer Services; and Manufacturing segments. The company offers logs, decking and flooring, sawn timber, recycled and synthesized charcoal, machine-made charcoal, and essential oil products. It also provides IT and business consultancy services. In addition, it engages in trading carbon credits. The company serves importers, retailers, and processors through its sales network. The company was formerly known as Nature Wood Group Limited and changed its name to CL Workshop Group Limited in December 2025. The company was incorporated in 2011 and is headquartered in Macau. As of October 22, 2025, CL Workshop Group Limited operates as a subsidiary of TUTU Business Services Limited."}}